From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Aditya Prayoga <aditya@kobol.io>
Date: Tue, 15 Sep 2020 20:04:22 +0700
Subject: arm64: dts: rockchip: helios64: add the power LED on PWM3

pwm-leds for the power LED on PWM3 (GPIO0_A6).

Upstream: none; left out of the LED submission because the RC on
PWR_LED_OFF (schematic sheet 29) keeps the LED lit.

Split out of add-board-helios64.patch (Aditya Prayoga, rebased onto
mainline by rpardini for 6.3); the DTB content is unchanged.

Signed-off-by: Aditya Prayoga <aditya@kobol.io>
Assisted-by: LLM
Signed-off-by: Igor Velkov <iav@iav.lv>
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/rk3399-kobol-helios64.dts | 15 ++++++++++
 1 file changed, 15 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/rk3399-kobol-helios64.dts b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/rk3399-kobol-helios64.dts
index 111111111111..222222222222 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/rk3399-kobol-helios64.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/rk3399-kobol-helios64.dts
@@ -194,6 +194,17 @@ fault-led {
 		};
 	};
 
+	pwmleds {
+		compatible = "pwm-leds";
+		status = "okay";
+
+		power-led {
+			label = "helios64:blue:power-status";
+			pwms = <&pwm3 0 2000000000 0>;
+			max-brightness = <255>;
+		};
+	};
+
 	hdd_a_power: regulator-hdd-a-power {
 		compatible = "regulator-fixed";
 		enable-active-high;
@@ -666,6 +677,10 @@ &pwm1 {
 	status = "okay";
 };
 
+&pwm3 {
+	status = "okay";
+};
+
 &saradc {
 	vref-supply = <&vcc1v8_s3>;
 	status = "okay";
-- 
Armbian

